4␀␀˙%Autorater config used for evaluation.NzÑNumber of samples for each instance in the dataset.
  If not specified, the default is 4. Minimum value is 1, maximum value
  is 32.rè␀␀aù␀␀Optional. Default is true. Whether to flip the candidate and baseline
