d teacher model. Distillation only.zGMultiplier for adjusting the weight of the SFT loss. Distillation only.zKThe Google Cloud Storage location where the tuning job outputs are written.zÀThe encryption spec of the tuning job. Customer-managed encryption key options for a TuningJob. If this is set, then all resources created by the TuningJob will be encrypted with provided encryption key.zRReward function configuration for reinforcement tuning. Reinforcement tuning only.z\Composite reward function configuration for reinforcement tuning. Reinforcement tuning only.z^Number of different responses to generate per prompt during tuning. Reinforcement tuning only.zYHow often at steps to evaluate the tuning job during training. Reinforcement tuning only.zRHow often at steps to save checkpoints during training. Reinforcement tuning only.zOThe maximum number of tokens to generate per prompt. Reinforcement tuning only.zoIndicates the maximum thinking depth. Use with earlier models shall result in error. Reinforcement tuning only.a*␀␀Cloud Storage path to file containing validation dataset for tuning. The dataset must be formatted as a JSONL file. If no validation dataset is provided, by default the API splits 25% of the training dataset or 50 examples, whichever is larger, as the validation dataset. Reinforcement tuning only.c␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ûx␀␀<Ä␀V␀^8Ñ␀␀d␀␀␀Qh/␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R	&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R
