      zThe content to cache.
      z(Developer set system instruction.
      zIA list of `Tools` the model may use to generate the next response.
      zOConfiguration for the tools to use. This config is shared for all tools.
      a␀␀The Cloud KMS resource identifier of the customer managed
      encryption key used to protect a resource.
      The key needs to be in the same region as where the compute resource is
      created. See
      https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/general/cmek for more
      details. If this is set, then all created CachedContent objects
