ClaudeFileinG␀␀·%␀␀A file that can be referenced by ID from subsequent Claude model requests.

The JSON representation of this message matches the Claude Files API File
object field-for-field, so that code written against that API parses these
responses unchanged. This data type is not supported in Gemini API.
Nz4Output only. The time at which the file was created.rè␀␀zëOutput only. Whether the contents of this file can be retrieved with `DownloadFile`. False for user-uploaded files, true for tool-generated ones.z∑Output only. The time at which the file expires and is deleted, set from the `expires_in_seconds` upload form field. Unset for files that do not expire, which is serialised as `null`.zÕOutput only. The original name of the uploaded file, taken from the `Content-Disposition` header on upload. Between 1 and 255 characters. Control characters and the characters `<>:"|?*\/` are not accepted.zàOutput only. The server-assigned identifier of the file, for example `file_abc123`. This is the ID to pass in subsequent model requests.ziOutput only. The media type of the file, taken from the `Content-Type` header of the file part on upload.z+Output only. The size of the file in bytes.z,Output only. The object type. Always `file`.c␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Û"␀␀<Ä␀V␀^8Ñ␀␀d␀␀␀Qh/␀S[␀S[P␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[P␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀S[␀S[,␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀;R&␀␀␀#␀©	r%␀␀␀⁄
